# ARCHITECTURAL SYNCHRONIZATION LOG

## Current Refactoring State
- [x] **Components Modularized:** Domain split complete.
- [x] **Systems Modularized:** Domain split complete.
- [x] **UI Standardization:** `UIButtonFactory` and `AssetFactory` implemented for consistent, animated HUD.
- [x] **Slot-Entity Model:** Multi-launcher architecture established via child entities parented to ship hulls.

## Fleet & Drone Systems (v0.1.3 Update)
- [x] **Drone Escalation:** Tier 5 debut (1 slot) scaling to Tier 13 (4 slots, 16 drones per slot).
- [x] **Automatic Provisioning:** Reaching T5, T9, T11, T13 automatically grants slots and stock guardian modules.
- [x] **Drone Market:** Stations now stock tiered procedural drone modules.
- [x] **Joystick Multi-Mode:** PlayerInputSystem supports toggling between Weapon Aim and Drone Focus.
- [x] **Persistent Lock:** Drones maintain their stationing angle relative to the ship even when joystick is released.
- [x] **Vanguard Directive:** Persistent in-game reticle and data-tether visualization for fleet focus.

## Discovery & Evolution (v0.1.3 Update)
- [x] **Discovery Briefing:** Major tier evolutions now trigger an "Evolution Report" modal instead of a simple choice.
- [x] **Full Hardware Sync:** Evolution automatically applies new Tier baseline (Weapon DNA, Turret count, Drone provisioning).
- [x] **UI Depth:** "Nexus Specimen Chambers" refactored into top-layer hollow frames with high-bit pixel art depth.

## Technical Refinements
- [x] **DPS Normalization:** Power curve set to 3.2x DPS per Tier based on 3-subtier (a, b, c) model.
- [x] **UI Legibility:** High-contrast terminal data-caps and large technical numerals implemented in StatBar.
- [x] **Resource Safety:** Defensive `skin.has()` checks implemented in ProjectileIcon to prevent lifecycle crashes.

## Verification Protocol
1. **Build Integrity:** Gradle `core:compileKotlin` passed.
2. **Write Verification Rule:** Adhered to for all v0.1.3 updates.
